The discussion group for Lojban at Yahoogroups.

As pointed out [http://66.111.43.200/~jkominek/nuzban/wiki/index.php?LojbanSlang|here], this
is slang. (Sticklers for correctness can say ''la jboste''.)

Formerly known as ''jboxemymri'', according to my memory, but if so, then that must have been an old rafsi, since it now should be ''jboxelmri''. --((And))

Also ''dicnotyterbei''; ''dantni cecmu''.
